C,E|                                   MODERN TRADER (V.O.)                             
U|                         In the end Lewis Ranieri’s Mortgage                        
U|                         Backed Security mutated into a                             
U|                         monstrosity that collapsed the                             
U|                         whole world economy. And none of                           
U|                         the experts or leaders or talking                          
U|                         heads had a clue it was coming. I’m                        
U|                         guessing most of you still don’t                           
U|                         really know what happened. Yeah,                           
U|                         you got a sound bite you repeat so                         
U|                         you don’t sound dumb but come on...                        
T|               WE FADE TO BLACK.                                                    
