C,E|                                   MODERN TRADER (V.O.)                             
U|                         But there were some who saw it                             
U|                         coming... While the whole world was                        
U|                         having a big ol’ party, a few                              
U|                         outsiders and weirdos saw what no                          
U|                         one else could. Not me, I’m not a                          
U|                         weirdo. I’m pretty cool. We’ll meet                        
U|                         later. These outsiders saw the                             
U|                         giant lie at the heart of the                              
U|                         economy. And they saw it by doing                          
U|                         something the rest of the suckers                          
U|                         never thought to do: they looked.                          
