O|
C|                                   SELENA GOMEZ                             *       
U|                         So here’s how a synthetic CDO                      *       
U|                         works. Let’s say I make a bet of 10                *       
U|                         million on a black jack hand...                    *       
O|
C|                                   DR. THALER                               *       
U|                         10 million because this hand                       *       
U|                         represents a simple mortgage bond.                 *       
N|               She is dealt a Jack and an 8 by the dealer.                  *       
O|
C,E|                                   DR. THALER (CONT’D)                      *       
U|                         Selena is showing 18 and the dealer                *       
U|                         is showing a seven. So the odds are                *       
U|                         very much in Selena’s favor. 87% to                *       
U|                         be exact. Which are like the great                 *       
U|                         odds most perceived the housing                    *       
U|                         market to have.                                    *       
O|
