U|                         right?                                             *       
O|
C|                                   DR. THALER                               *       
U|                         We have done countless studies that                *       
U|                         show that people often make this                   *       
U|                         error in their thinking. If                        *       
U|                         something is happening-- like                      *       
U|                         Selena winning seven hands in a row                *       
C|                                   SELENA GOMEZ                             *       
