O|
C|                                   DR. THALER                               *       
U|                         Exactly. They think it will go on                  *       
U|                         forever. It’s called extrapolation                 *       
U|                         bias. People see something                         *       
U|                         happening and they extrapolate that                *       
U|                         it will continue to happen.                        *       
C|                                   SELENA GOMEZ                             *       
U|                         So the people who are watching and                 *       
